                                        "entry_id": "ce9766f9-937c-3372-ac1e-253d48ae6505",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Ancient Greek; best known for a ninth century missionary to the Slavs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bdebb2b-9fb3-4996-b3b3-3222e171626d",
                                                "sense_id": "644b8420-a45e-3e30-bbc1-25cb1d694a48",
                                                "text": "Boxers, too, not so long ago a somewhat uncouth section of the community who were seldom if ever mistaken for members of the Vere de Vere family, have taken on a polish which makes their society a pleasure. They have names like Cyril and Percy and Clarence and live up to them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91bc4665-b802-47e8-b95f-188cbb9aef93",
                                                "sense_id": "644b8420-a45e-3e30-bbc1-25cb1d694a48",
                                                "text": "Zuma – a fierce critic of current ANC leader and South African President Cyril Ramaphosa – was forced to resign as president in 2018 and has been looking for political revenge ever since."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
